flowchart TD
    A[Student Login<br/>/login?role=student] --> B{Auth Check}
    B -->|Valid JWT| C[Student Portal: /student]
    B -->|Invalid| A

    C --> D{Student Dashboard Tabs}

    %% Digital ID Card Flow
    D -->|Click Digital ID Tab| E1[Load Digital ID<br/>GET /api/student/id]
    E1 --> F1[Display QR Badge<br/>Dynamic QR Code]
    F1 --> G1[Student Info Card<br/>Photo, Roll No, Branch, Year]
    G1 --> H1{Action Buttons}
    H1 -->|Download QR| I1[Generate PNG/PDF<br/>GET /api/student/id/download]
    H1 -->|Refresh QR| J1[Regenerate Token<br/>POST /api/student/id/refresh]
    H1 -->|Add to Wallet| K1[Apple Wallet / Google Pay Pass]

    %% Campus Status Flow
    D -->|Click Status Tab| E2[Load Live Status<br/>GET /api/student/status]
    E2 --> F2{Check Current State}
    F2 -->|INSIDE CAMPUS| G2[Status Badge: On Campus]
    G2 --> H2[Last Entry Details<br/>Gate Name, Time, Operator]
    H2 --> I2[Curfew Countdown<br/>Time Remaining: X Hours]
    F2 -->|OUTSIDE CAMPUS| G3[Status Badge: Off Campus]
    G3 --> H3[Active Pass Details<br/>Pass Type, Destination, Expiry]
    H3 --> I3[Return Countdown<br/>Time Left to Return]
    F2 -->|HOSTEL| G4[Status Badge: In Hostel]
    G4 --> H4[Room Check-in Status<br/>Block, Room No]

    %% Outing Pass Flow
    D -->|Click Pass Hub Tab| E3[Load Passes<br/>GET /api/student/passes]
    E3 --> F3[Display Pass Cards<br/>Active, Pending, History]
    F3 --> G3{Click Action}
    G3 -->|Request New Pass| H5[Navigate to /student/passes/new]
    H5 --> I5[Pass Request Form]
    I5 --> J5[Select Pass Type<br/>Day Outing / Medical / Home Leave / Late Pass]
    J5 --> K5[Fill Form Fields<br/>Date, Time, Destination, Reason]
    K5 --> L5[Click Submit Button]
    L5 --> M5[POST /api/passes/request]
    M5 --> N5[Show Success Message<br/>Pass Request Sent]
    N5 --> O5[Navigate Back to /student/passes]
    
    G3 -->|View Pass Details| H6[Pass Detail Modal]
    H6 --> I6[Display QR Code<br/>Pass ID, Approval Chain]
    I6 --> J6{Modal Actions}
    J6 -->|Download Pass| K6[PDF with QR<br/>GET /api/passes/:id/download]
    J6 -->|Cancel Pass| L6[Confirm Cancellation -> POST /api/passes/:id/cancel]
    J6 -->|Close| M6[Close Modal]

    %% Activity History Flow
    D -->|Click History Tab| E4[Load Entry/Exit Log<br/>GET /api/student/history]
    E4 --> F4[Timeline View<br/>Chronological List]
    F4 --> G4[Each Entry Card Shows<br/>Direction IN/OUT, Gate, Time]
    G4 --> H7[Filter Options]
    H7 --> I7{Apply Filter}
    I7 -->|Date Range| J7[Date Picker -> Refetch Data]
    I7 -->|Gate Filter| K7[Dropdown -> Refetch Data]
    I7 -->|Export| L7[Generate CSV/PDF<br/>GET /api/student/history/export]

    %% Profile & Security Flow
    D -->|Click Profile Tab| E5[Student Profile Page<br/>/student/profile]
    E5 --> F5[Profile Info Section]
    F5 --> G5[Click Edit Profile Button]
    G5 --> H8[Edit Form Modal<br/>Email, Phone, Emergency Contact]
    H8 --> I8[Update Fields -> Click Save]
    I8 --> J8[PATCH /api/student/profile]
    J8 --> K8[Success Toast -> Reload Profile]

    E5 --> F6[Security Settings Section]
    F6 --> G6{Security Actions}
    G6 -->|Enroll WebAuthn| H9[Browser Biometric Prompt<br/>Fingerprint / Face ID]
    H9 --> I9[POST /api/auth/webauthn/register]
    I9 --> J9[Success: Biometric Enrolled]
    G6 -->|Change Password| H10[Password Change Form]
    H10 --> I10[Old Password, New Password Fields]
    I10 --> J10[Click Update Password]
    J10 --> K10[POST /api/auth/change-password]
    K10 --> L10[Success Toast -> Force Re-login]

    %% Notifications Flow
    C --> X[Bell Icon Click]
    X --> Y[Notifications Dropdown<br/>GET /api/notifications]
    Y --> Z{Click Notification}
    Z -->|Pass Approved| A1[Navigate to /student/passes]
    Z -->|Alert / Curfew Warning| A2[Show Alert Modal]
    Z -->|Announcement| A3[Navigate to /announcements/:id]

    %% Logout Flow
    C --> B1[Profile Menu -> Logout]
    B1 --> B2[POST /api/auth/logout]
    B2 --> B3[Clear Tokens & Session]
    B3 --> A
